# derive title-attachment stage using the heading text blocks), an ordering-info
# table exists that no recipe classifies (must land in gaps), and the VDSS ratings
# cell is deliberately mis-encoded as "500" so the patch fixture (keyed by this
# table's pre-patch content hash) corrects it to 50.
